  "post_content": "<p>Radio Luxemburgo, grupo local de rock de todos los tiempos, desgran&oacute; anoche su repertorio en la Font de Dins de Onda, en un concierto gratuito patrocinado por Les Tasques, L&#39;Entrep&agrave; y el nuevo local L&#39;Almud, que abri&oacute; sus puerta el viernes por la noche.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/radioluxemburgofontdins/img_0387.jpg\" alt=\"img_0387\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/radioluxemburgofontdins/img_0388.jpg\" alt=\"img_0388\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/radioluxemburgofontdins/img_0389.jpg\" alt=\"img_0389\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/radioluxemburgofontdins/img_0390.jpg\" alt=\"img_0390\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/radioluxemburgofontdins/img_0391.jpg\" alt=\"img_0391\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/radioluxemburgofontdins/img_0392.jpg\" alt=\"img_0392\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/radioluxemburgofontdins/img_0393.jpg\" alt=\"img_0393\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/radioluxemburgofontdins/img_0394.jpg\" alt=\"img_0394\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/radioluxemburgofontdins/img_0395.jpg\" alt=\"img_0395\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/radioluxemburgofontdins/img_0396.jpg\" alt=\"img_0396\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https: